{"game": "space-marine-2", "language": "english", "appid": 2183900, "month": "2025-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1735689600, "end_date": 1736294399, "month_true_total": 3084, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-09-11 02:21:17 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "185060320", "author": {"steamid": "76561198346922080", "personaname": "Kurisu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198346922080/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 949, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 814, "last_played": 1773869854, "avatar": "aeb679bef4e764bbe6f63068e3339d899ef63a99"}, "language": "english", "review": "FOR THE EMPEROR!", "timestamp_created": 1736293453, "timestamp_updated": 1736293453, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185059924", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056706118", "personaname": "Grickels", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198056706118/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 21166, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20371, "last_played": 1784415001, "avatar": "9bfc650f4ac4e89dfbeecf9b1b2fb1ae851884db"}, "language": "english", "review": "Combat in this game feels great. Its Gory , bloody and fun. Campaign is awesome and Operations are fun as well", "timestamp_created": 1736292787, "timestamp_updated": 1736292787, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185059796", "author": {"steamid": "76561198800806725", "personaname": "bwood", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198800806725/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 8938, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 174, "playtime_at_review": 3177, "last_played": 1788995588, "avatar": "82b1bcae2bdc3ac16cd1613afef1698361d735bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good game. New to Warhammer 40k because of this. About 9 hours on the campaign. And almost all of my playtime is grinding on the operations game mode. It does have leveling and has 5 different difficulties. It reminds me of Gears of War 3. Very fun game in general.", "timestamp_created": 1736292401, "timestamp_updated": 1736292436, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185058416", "author": {"steamid": "76561198337191131", "personaname": "Castle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198337191131/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 3769, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3201, "last_played": 1739406032, "avatar": "dd595aaefceef56fc2148c2cfa07773d8a9361ce"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, great coop and PVE. But please, balance the melee classes in PVP. PVP is almost unplayable.", "timestamp_created": 1736290777, "timestamp_updated": 1736290777, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185057274", "author": {"steamid": "76561198323622366", "personaname": "FindDanteHere", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198323622366/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 14689, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14689, "last_played": 1768096518, "avatar": "14f1a9927382fa8dea134a0f3ca6f17e6938e131"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is absolutely amazing. Some of the elements are a bit dated and reminds me of older multiplayer games made for the 360 or PS3 but I think that is what makes it work. Not your typical live service game where they drop skins and emotes to purchase every other day that either look out of place or give an unfair advantage either. It has that older Gears of War feel to it and the DLC content release is similar to that of CoD back in the day when they would release map packs opposed to the modern day \"battle pass\". \n\nI will say there is an issue with load times as well as connectivity, (as of today's date) that should not be happening on a modern game such as this. It isn't my CPU failing or anything on my end, it is a known problem among the community. You can get booted out of your game and lose all progress due to server issues; the problem is that there is no real work around for this until the devs put out an update that fixes it... for now that is because it's happened more than once. Either way, really fun game that you can play casually with friends or play extremely sweaty in the PvP modes. The campaign is also really great and has an extensive lore for any new players to get invested into. 8.9/10 for me\n\n\n\nEDIT: Coming back to this game in 2026 has been extremely refreshing. There have been a lot of QOL changes to the game, and I glad to see where the game has evolved to. Not a perfect game, but a great game nonetheless. FOR THE EMPEROR!!!", "timestamp_created": 1736289737, "timestamp_updated": 1779563278, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185057270", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992753872", "personaname": "PewMeowPaw", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pewmeowpaw/", "num_games_owned": 1388, "num_reviews": 88, "playtime_forever": 165, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 154, "last_played": 1765477843, "avatar": "0f4d154c0d1e173e71fdf5b95f2c61227f9c5b97"}, "language": "english", "review": "Uses Kernel Level Anti-Cheat\nEasy Anti-Cheat", "timestamp_created": 1736289735, "timestamp_updated": 1736289735, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "185056445", "author": {"steamid": "76561199137316602", "personaname": "ChickenKing9999", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199137316602/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 774, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 463, "last_played": 1766203477, "avatar": "e9e98e67e1bcc752ae6d0e6a70b67bb1ea6eab10"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good Game\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1736288951, "timestamp_updated": 1736288951, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185056394", "author": {"steamid": "76561198802498076", "personaname": "SOLQK", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198802498076/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 8042, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3391, "last_played": 1771218549, "avatar": "084af891daa18ba206ff6cf6bf399b4233377b2b"}, "language": "english", "review": "So far 90% of my playtime is spent on PVP alone, the aesthetic, OST, gameplay, the space marines, the girth! It all instantly hooked me, and brought back that online competitive itch that Gears of War 2 & 3 had on me back in the 360 days. I recommend to all GOW fans. Would love to see Ranked matches and Custom lobby's make their debut, along with cosmetic and armor options for the Heretic Astartes.", "timestamp_created": 1736288912, "timestamp_updated": 1736288912, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185056306", "author": {"steamid": "76561198310481998", "personaname": "Mäkmälemän", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Turkamanchai/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1065, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 640, "last_played": 1746887004, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best game experience that I have had.", "timestamp_created": 1736288839, "timestamp_updated": 1736288839, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185056224", "author": {"steamid": "76561198353542725", "personaname": "Tabularius", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198353542725/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 23852, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 49, "playtime_at_review": 21921, "last_played": 1788550287, "avatar": "eb7cef67cfbb856f828f959821e9abd832500928"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you enjoy horde shooters, chainsaw swords, or gratuitous violence against bugs, this game is an absolute blast.\n\nFor the Emperor!", "timestamp_created": 1736288775, "timestamp_updated": 1767913821, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}]}